[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=a module for inserting a string prefix on an adjustable array of||1
  Cmn2=input strings, and also allows for an alternate string to replace||1
  Cmn3=the main prefix.\\(this module is mainly meant for adding a prefix||1
  Cmn4=(the processor IP) to serial source icon strings, and then replacing||1
  Cmn5=that string when a device is not \\on the local network (replacing||1
  Cmn6=it with a dynamic dns hostname, http://mycrestron.com or similar)\\
  Cmn7=\\\\Inputs\\\\useExternalPrefix: when this signal goes high, stringPrefix_Externa
  Cmn8=l will replace stringPrefix_Internal on all outputString signals.
  Cmn9=\\\\	NOTE: when this signal goes low, all strings will revert to||1
  Cmn10=the Internal prefix\\\\stringPrefix_Internal: the main string (processor||1
  Cmn11=IP address) to prefix all stringToPrefix strings with.\\\\stringPrefix_External:
  Cmn12=||1the secondary (dyndns hostname) to prefix all stringToPrefix strings||1
  Cmn13=with whenever the useExternalPrefix signal goes high.\\\\stringToPrefix:
  Cmn14=||1an array of strings to prefix, usually icon paths on the processor||1
  Cmn15=to be prefixed with an IP address or hostname\\\\Outputs\\\\outputString:
  Cmn16=||1an array of strings with the prefix added into it. \\	
[END]
